  "body_text": "一个有趣的新包装即将诞生\n‍‍‍‍\n它取材了咖啡豆/种植咖啡的山型/手冲时的滤杯等元素\n‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n同时，再一次强化VPH的代表的意义，预计端午上线～jajaja\n‍‍‍‍‍‍\nVarietal - 品种， 我们口中所谈论的咖啡风味和各种话题的\n源头\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\nProcess - 加工处理，将咖啡这个农产品变为最终饮品的\n过程\n‍‍\nHeart - 从种子到杯子，产业链上的各个环节，都需要很多人的认真\n投入\n‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n微缩版\n‍\n‍\n大致展开的样子\n‍‍‍\n期待成品的到来～YEAH！\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          一个有趣的新包装即将诞生\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          它取材了咖啡豆/种植咖啡的山型/手冲时的滤杯等元素\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          同时，再一次强化VPH的代表的意义，预计端午上线～jajaja\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Varietal - 品种， 我们口中所谈论的咖啡风味和各种话题的\n          <strong>\n           源头\n          </strong>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Process - 加工处理，将咖啡这个农产品变为最终饮品的\n          <strong>\n           过程\n          </strong>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Heart - 从种子到杯子，产业链上的各个环节，都需要很多人的认真\n          <strong>\n           投入\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RLOFZzUo2SoibkUC39q5SMzqicMr9IqHjLbhNnleZ9naZWn5Jq0LyWDWrvPticYcWiaMME5wAyYqsZhA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RLOFZzUo2SoibkUC39q5SMzlmhSKyAvAfcgdThPRU9mhnHVfqHXJKibJBEDbibTjW5e5W1Pqh6Wia3pA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          微缩版\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RLOFZzUo2SoibkUC39q5SMzQA8oIeTRyzrolWzibzjZuovAPOTucIKshwf1oHdKo2poZCL692dOhdQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          大致展开的样子\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍‍‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\"